	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Reverende in Christo pater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Tuas expecto; <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>cum has scriberem, nostri nondum redierant.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernas</placeName> est, cui has dedi; sed quoniam hominem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>non noram, nolui literas d. <persName>Martinengi</persName> cum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>actis concilii, quae apud me ad te habeo, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ei concredere.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Dubito tamen, an nostri sint <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>profecturi propter ingens frigus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Significare nihilominus volui, quo loco <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>res nostrae essent.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Ich hoff, gott wölle es noch <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>mit uns han; dan die Meylandischen be<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>schwärend sich der fürgeschlagnen articklen; <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>derhalben sy dem ambaßador geschriben, wyter <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nit fürzefaren, des er nit wenig erschrocken; <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>hat sich uff gestern uffgemacht, ist verritten, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>hat synen secretarium hye gelaßen, vermeint <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>den hertzogen ze berichten, damit er sich <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>der gestelten articklen settigen laße, wil nach <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ostern wider kommen.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Habes summam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Interim vi<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>gilandum, daa ir das best thuͦn werdend <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>und uns zuͦ yeder zyt berichten, was sich <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>hyezwüschen an allen orten endteckt, darmit, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>so ettwas betrugs darhinder, wir uns ester <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>baß wüßind ze vergoumen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Haec subito; <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>si nostri proficiscuntur, plura.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Consul noster <lb xml:id="p1z26"/><persName ref="p3196">Tscharnerus</persName> post 8 dies ad vos veniet <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>et de omnibus coram.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, reverende <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>pater.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">13. martii anno 1564.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>T[uus] <persName>F[abricius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Cupimus ex vobis scire, quid in <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>causa <placeName>Glaronensi</placeName> actum et an pestis apud <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>vos invalescat; <placeName ref="l93">Clavennae</placeName> certe vellicat.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Amplissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino suo et in <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Christo patri honorando.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> an herren <lb xml:id="p2z6"/><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>n.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
